  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Assistance and Protection for Irregular Migrants and Their Communities in Lebanon</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IOM will implement this project to meet the protection and assistance needs of Lebanese migrants, non-refugee populations, and refugees attempting to leave by sea, by i.) meeting the immediate life-saving humanitarian and longer-term protection needs of irregular migrants, refugees, and/or their families in the wake of incidents at sea or boat returns, including through direct assistance and strengthening community-based protection mechanisms, ii.) strengthening community awareness to prevent irregular migration/onward movements in targeted areas, and iii.) developing state and other actors&#x2019; capacity to respond effectively and appropriately to irregular migration incidences at sea or at the point of departure.</narrative>
  </description>
